Cozette (vendored)

* What

  Cozette is a 6×13 px bitmap programming font, MIT-licensed,
  upstream at https://github.com/the-moonwitch/Cozette. We use it
  as the default font for the fb-embed dumper / embedding hosts so
  rendered output is pixel-crisp + monospace out of the box.

* What's here

  cozette.bdf  — runtime artefact (~700 KiB), what mlterm loads via
                 the new BDF support in uitoolkit/fb/ui_font.c
  LICENSE      — upstream MIT, unmodified

* Why BDF and not PCF

  We tried .pcf first (converted from .bdf via bdftopcf). mlterm's
  upstream pcf rendering pipeline draws each glyph row twice into
  the descender area, garbling output — likely a bdftopcf metrics
  quirk mlterm doesn't account for. Same input via .bdf through
  freetype's bdf module renders cleanly.

* Pinned version

  v1.30.0 — https://github.com/the-moonwitch/Cozette/releases/tag/v.1.30.0

* How to update

    curl -sL -o vendor/cozette/cozette.bdf \
      https://github.com/the-moonwitch/Cozette/releases/download/v.1.30.0/cozette.bdf
